Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Harden the Recycle Bin implementation. Fix the Properties dialog
 initialization so drive items are allocated before insertion and the dialog
 survives empty drive lists. Use the ReactOS native DeleteFileToRecycleBinW API
 in SHFileOperationW so files deleted through the shell are moved to the
 Recycle Bin instead of being permanently deleted, guarding against short or
 non-canonical paths. Fix Recycle Bin item attribute reporting for CDefView by
 validating items and reporting folder attributes correctly. Skip inaccessible
 drives when emptying and during system-wide enumeration, because Wine exposes
 the Unix root drive (Z:) as a fixed drive but denies access to its recycle
 bin. Force the desktop Recycle Bin icon to refresh after emptying by calling
 SHUpdateRecycleBinIcon, which sends SHCNE_UPDATEIMAGE(-1) and reliably
 refreshes every desktop icon.
